:''This enemy has no official name.''
'''Cow Doge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appeared in [[A Colossal New Year!]] during New Year's 2021. It was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cow Doge
|image = E 537.png
|appearance = [[A Colossal New Year!]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a [[Doge]] wearing a cow costume. It moves as fast as a [[Doge Dark]] but has ''slightly'' lower stats than it, making it a bit more threatening than a regular Doge. However, in its final debut levels, it is buffed to a point comparable to [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]], without the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] trait.

